                                "sense_id": "fa9f5127-ae73-36b4-8985-87669d9bd07d",
                                "text": "When a coppice woodland is no longer cut on its regular rotation the rods from the stool continue to grow and the coppice becomes known as overstood. Sadly, in many parts of the country this is the commonest form of coppice you are likely to see."
